@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180
@organizationId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@scopeId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Available BusinessIQ profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/document-profiles

### Add a scoped business procedure (Development only: no token required)
# scopeId is an opaque document boundary, not a complete business/location hierarchy.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Supplier approval policy",
  "content": "The supplier approval policy requires a manager to verify delivery evidence before approving a purchase.",
  "profile": "business-operations",
  "tenantId": "{{organizationId}}",
  "scopeId": "{{scopeId}}",
  "language": "en"
}

### Ask about the policy
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What does the supplier approval policy require?",
  "profile": "business-operations",
  "tenantId": "{{organizationId}}",
  "scopeId": "{{scopeId}}",
  "maxResults": 5
}

### Add organization-wide financial evidence (review notice; no calculations)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Reviewed quarterly report",
  "content": "The quarterly report records increased supplier costs. Management should review the supporting invoices before taking action.",
  "profile": "financial-documents",
  "tenantId": "{{organizationId}}",
  "language": "en"
}

### Explain the financial evidence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What does the quarterly report record?",
  "profile": "financial-documents",
  "tenantId": "{{organizationId}}",
  "maxResults": 5
}

### Create a business (Development only; production requires owner membership)
# @name createBusiness
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/businesses
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "North Construction",
  "industry": "Construction"
}

### Get the created business
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/businesses/{{createBusiness.response.body.$.data.id}}
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}

### Paginate using the inherited read-only controller
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/businesses/filtered-search?PageNumber=1&PageSize=20&SortBy=Name
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}

### Update using the inherited CRUD controller
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/businesses
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{createBusiness.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "name": "North Builders",
  "industry": "Construction"
}

### Archive using the inherited delete method
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/businesses/{{createBusiness.response.body.$.data.id}}
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
